                                                "sense_id": "dd7d5380-37d7-3f26-843f-843b995af20e",
                                                "text": "[A]nd the post mortem performed handily and swiftly right at the edge of the grave, so that the inwards which had caused the pig's death preceded him into the ground and he lay at last resting squarely on the cause of his own undoing."
